# docs-notes/ is the owner's local working material and is NOT tracked. Everything a reader
# needs is committed under docs/: ROADMAP.md (where we are), adr/ (why), PEER_REVIEW.md, and
# archive/ (superseded plans and session notes, kept for history only).
docs-notes/

BACKLOG.md
ROADMAP_V1_RENFORCEE.md
ROADMAP_V2_FULL.md
chatgpt.md

